  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-9ca44200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm slices. Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water to soak. Set aside.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Grate carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• Thinly slice apple into wedges. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the carrot will help the fritters crisp up in the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-fa2b8410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine corn, carrot, the plain flour, egg, milk, Nan’s special seasoning and Cheddar cheese.\n• Season with pepper.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes. Mix well to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-5e197d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don’t flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• Return large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest. TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-84290c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of the balsamic vinegar and olive oil.\n• Season with salt and pepper, then add apple and spinach & rocket mix. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-ff063840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Nan’s sweetcorn and fetta fritters, haloumi, fries and apple salad between plates.\n• Drizzle dill & parsley mayonnaise over the fritters.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834013cd9848b9dac04a2e5/step-a954b750.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
